990 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/P 936 0 R
/T (PneuFlex is a low-cost, wearable pneumatic \(1\) rehabilitation sleeve designed to assist upper arm movement for individuals who suffer from muscle atrophy or limited mobility. The system uses a soft McKibben actuator \(2\), embedded flex sensors, an ESP32E microcontroller and adaptive control software within a lightweight sleeve. PneuFlex includes real-time monitoring and data logging capabilities with a companion app and TinyML AI adaptive software to support rehabilitation tracking. PneuFlex was designed for accessibility and scalability, providing affordable assistive support for home therapy and clinical environments while also promoting improved functional independence. )
/E (PneuFlex is a low-cost, wearable pneumatic \(1\) rehabilitation sleeve designed to assist upper arm movement for individuals who suffer from muscle atrophy or limited mobility. The system uses a soft McKibben actuator \(2\), embedded flex sensors, an ESP32E microcontroller and adaptive control software within a lightweight sleeve. PneuFlex includes real-time monitoring and data logging capabilities with a companion app and TinyML AI adaptive software to support rehabilitation tracking. PneuFlex was designed for accessibility and scalability, providing affordable assistive support for home therapy and clinical environments while also promoting improved functional independence. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [28]
>>
endobj
