/Title (We created PneuFlex because accessible rehabilitation solutions are limited. A close friend of ours, Forrest, suffered an injury that directly led to muscle atrophy. His muscles deteriorated from inactivity, making movement strenuous. Throughout recovery, the lack of consistent, accessible rehabilitation treatments directly contributed to a lengthy recovery process. This was our inspiration for creating PneuFlex.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5678 0 R
>>
endobj
